{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p043a","title":"皇甫谧梦洛阳诛曹爽醒与邑人论强弱","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p043a-account","label":"《汉晋春秋》","text":"皇甫谧梦洛阳诛曹爽醒与邑人论强弱","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p043a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xiahoucao-p0092","role":"梦而论事","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p043a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":248,"label":"正始九年冬","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y248","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o065","basis":"正始九年冬"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p043a-q","xiahoucao-q-o065","xiahoucao-q-b-689bb125a4b85ddbcec4"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-p043a-q","source_order":[9,377,"P043a"],"order":2300}],"persons":[{"id":"xiahoucao-p0092","name":"皇甫谧","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p043a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-3d56ad29514a24dd284c","layer":"pei","quote":"《汉晋春秋》曰：“安定皇甫谧，以九年冬梦至洛阳，自庙出，见车骑甚众，以物呈庙云：‘诛大将军曹爽。’寤而以告其邑人，邑人曰：‘君欲作曹人之梦乎？朝无公孙强，如何？且爽兄弟典重兵，又权尚书事，谁敢谋之！’谧曰：‘爽无叔振铎之请，苟失天机，则离矣，何恃于强？昔汉之阎显，倚母后之尊，权国威命，可谓至重矣；阉人十九人，一旦尸之，况爽兄弟乎？’”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":376,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":0,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-689bb125a4b85ddbcec4","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-689bb125a4b85ddbcec4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖22〗九年：正始九年（公元 248）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":305,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e0757d03d6de78145e0e","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o065","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-3bc419f393ba695bc235","layer":"original","quote":"宣王密为之备。九年冬〖22〗，李胜出为荆州刺史，往诣